                <dia:string>#Every type must be registered. DataTypeRegister is where registered types reside.
Some types are registered by default. DataTypeRegister includes registering of
default types. Default registerd types are scalar types like int, float, double,
std::string and Pointer types. ALSO DataTypeRegister include registering of 
transform functions. There are some default transform functions which are, to_lower,
to_upper, format, round. We get VariableDefinition of DataVariable which defines the 
type of that variable using DataTypeRegister.#</dia:string>
